<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-TI raised to &quot;buy&quot; at BZW.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-TI raised to &quot;buy&quot; at BZW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Specialist engineer TI Group Plc was raised to &quot;buy&quot; from &quot;hold&quot; at BZW, market sources said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Sources said BZW pointed to recent declines in the stock, which touched a five-month low of 526-3/4 on January 27, and said TI was the sort of high-quality growth stock which it looked to buy on weakness.</p>
<p>Yesterday analysts at SBC Warburg said TI was oversold following its recent decline.</p>
<p>TI shares were unchanged at 548-1/2 by 1026 GMT.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
